            <ArticleTitle>[Chronic abdominal pain: lipoma of the small intestine].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>313-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors present a case of submucous lipoma of the jejunum in a 6 years old boy. They point out the rarity of these tumors in children and the unusual aspect of the lesion, the circular, stenotic shape has never been noted elsewhere.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
